    "Id": "chassisdef_guillotine_GLT-7MP",
    "Name": "Guillotine",
    "Details": "A prototype improvement of the -6WB that never went into larger production due to the defeat of the Blakist forces. Through the combination of both Endo Steel structure and Ferro-Fibrous armor, the prototype managed to fit both an ER Large Laser and a Light Gauss Rifle in the left arm. Four ER Medium Lasers and a Streak SRM4 launcher provides closer range firepower as needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Integrated Searchlight</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Right Lower, Left Upper</color>",
